# Out of the museum by night without the fade, LbaWinSettings: 194
# (fixtures/nofadedark: the CD's LBA.CFG with that key and a
# save of the museum by night, Twinsen put inside its side door, zone 22,
# at 10752 256 31744 and facing it, bytes 270 to 277). Up as the save
# loads walks him out before a guard takes him, into scene 42, which
# comes in at once in its own palette, where the Classic keeps the
# museum's.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 0.3
down Up
sleep 1.8
up Up
shot out
sleep 2
shot street
sleep 2
shot end
